commits.message:
chore(compose): meeting-api gets ADMIN_API_URL for the auto-join + calendar-sync sweeps

The two background sweeps call admin-api's internal edges (bot-context, calendar-configs);
without the URL calendar sync no-ops and auto-join spawns without the per-user cap.

docs: capability truth table (browser view · speak · recording playback · webhooks · MCP)

Verified against the tree, not planning docs: terminal has no bot browser
view, no TTS-speak surface, and no recording player (retrieval is API-only);
speak is contract-sealed but dead-ends at meeting-api (404, no act publisher);
recordings API is live + module-tested but the live capture→storage→playback
loop is unvalidated; user webhooks + MCP are module-tested only, untested
against real receivers/clients. roadmap/status gains the layer-by-layer table;
how-to/recordings gains the API-only note.
